{"pin":"BH10840","subcodes":[{"code":"BH10840","anchor":"","first_line":"O Lord! Deprive not Thy servants of the fruits of existence, and from the ocean of Thy bounty bestow their portion. Thou art verily He Who is the Omnipotent [3.5s]... ...My God, My Adored One! Deprive not Thy servants of the fruit of existence, and grant them their portion of the ocean of Thy generosity","first_line_orig":"عبادت را از ثمره وجود محروم منما و از بحر جودت قسمت عطا فرما توئی آن مقتدری که  ","language":"Per","word_count":"60","translations":[{"language":"tr","lang_name":"Turkish"}],"refs":[{"kind":"manuscript","code":"INBA30:081","source":"INBA30","locator":"081","url":"https://afnanlibrary.org/d/inba_v030/?page=44"},{"kind":"manuscript","code":"INBA65:021a","source":"INBA65","locator":"021a","url":"https://afnanlibrary.org/d/inba_v065/?page=23"},{"kind":"manuscript","code":"INBA81:011","source":"INBA81","locator":"011","url":"https://afnanlibrary.org/d/inba_v081/?page=14"},{"kind":"manuscript","code":"NLAI_BH_AB.017a","source":"NLAI_BH_AB","locator":"017a","url":"http://bluefin.live/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/NLAI.BH_AB_misc.pdf#page=17"},{"kind":"publication","code":"ADH1.014","source":"ADH1","locator":"014","url":"https://bahai-library.com/pdf/i/ishraq-khavari_adhkar_muqarrabin_1.pdf"},{"kind":"publication","code":"AHM.307","source":"AHM","locator":"307","url":"http://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/b/AHM/ahm-307.html"},{"kind":"publication","code":"AQMJ1.139a","source":"AQMJ1","locator":"139a","url":"http://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/b/MMQ1/mmq1-141.html"},{"kind":"publication","code":"DWNP_v1#01 p.007","source":"DWNP_v1","locator":"01 p.007","url":"https://afnanlibrary.org/d/the-dawn-vol-1-burma-1923"},{"kind":"translation","code":"ADMS#089","source":"ADMS","locator":"089","url":"https://adibmasumian.com/translations/bh10840/"}]},{"code":"BH10840FRU","anchor":"fru","translations":[{"language":"orig","lang_name":"Original"},{"language":"fa","lang_name":"Persian"}]}]}
